WEBVTT

00:06.140 --> 00:07.980
The Beast of Blue Fire?

00:09.130 --> 00:12.220
He's been showing up around 
Minerva and causing trouble.

00:14.410 --> 00:17.530
He looks a lot like the Magic 
Swordsman of Black Lightning.

00:17.530 --> 00:20.950
Ring any bells? Maybe 
a brother, or your dad?

00:20.950 --> 00:22.160
I don't have any.

00:22.380 --> 00:24.760
So what did the guy do, anyway?

00:25.090 --> 00:26.170
Well...

00:26.170 --> 00:29.590
When an old lady was struggling 
to pick up a heavy box...

00:29.590 --> 00:31.420
I shall assist you!

00:31.420 --> 00:34.660
My little Milk is gone!

00:34.660 --> 00:36.180
I found your kitty.

00:37.250 --> 00:39.540
This takes some perseverance.

00:39.540 --> 00:41.180
I shall assist!

00:41.180 --> 00:42.920
He sounds like a nice guy.

00:42.920 --> 00:44.370
Like hell he does.

00:44.370 --> 00:48.270
Jobs like that are important 
for low-ranked adventurers.

00:48.270 --> 00:51.070
And he's just out there 
doing them for free.

00:51.070 --> 00:53.210
Doing a really sloppy job, too.

00:56.140 --> 00:58.450
That's not my Milk!

00:59.950 --> 01:02.450
It's the roots I need!

01:02.450 --> 01:05.560
Thanks to the flood of complaints 
the guild's getting about him,

01:05.560 --> 01:07.980
I'm stuck in overtime 
hell every single day!

01:07.980 --> 01:10.120
Is he an adventurer?

01:10.120 --> 01:12.090
Nope. But...

01:12.550 --> 01:14.330
if we keep letting him run free,

01:14.330 --> 01:16.800
public trust in the guild 
is going to plummet.

01:16.800 --> 01:18.990
And worst of all, I'll 
never get to go home.

01:18.990 --> 01:19.600
So...

01:20.090 --> 01:22.360
I need you to go capture him ASAP.

01:22.700 --> 01:24.520
Don't be so flippant about it!

01:24.780 --> 01:28.970
Sheesh... Okay, fine. I'll help.

01:28.970 --> 01:31.270
The Magic Swordsman's 
reputation depends on it.

01:31.960 --> 01:36.280
Not to mention... I need to 
forget about Cecilia right now.

01:37.130 --> 01:38.590
Fwoosh! Ba-zing!

01:38.590 --> 01:40.970
I have accepted your quest!

01:40.970 --> 01:44.500
The Magic Swordsman shall 
solve your problem!

03:17.950 --> 03:20.220
Here's the plan Yoki came up with:

03:20.220 --> 03:24.160
he'll patrol the city with me, 
the captain of the knights,

03:24.160 --> 03:27.220
to show everyone he isn't 
the Beast of Blue Fire.

03:27.220 --> 03:30.500
And if we clean up after 
any trouble he causes,

03:30.500 --> 03:34.190
it'll improve the reputation of the guild
and the Magic Swordsman.

03:34.900 --> 03:37.650
Oh, my! You're the man from before!

03:37.650 --> 03:39.240
And who are you?

03:39.240 --> 03:40.750
It's me!

03:50.520 --> 03:52.970
Milk! Welcome home!

03:53.500 --> 03:56.830
I must depart for work once more.

03:56.830 --> 03:59.140
The quest I was given is not yet finished.

04:00.260 --> 04:03.260
Enjoy your date with no reservations.

04:03.260 --> 04:05.360
D-Date?!

04:05.360 --> 04:07.260
Thank you so much!

04:08.390 --> 04:09.960
You're really something.

04:09.960 --> 04:14.030
Well, the Magic Swordsman of 
Black Lightning is flawless.

04:14.360 --> 04:18.760
If the Beast would just show up already, 
we could catch him and be done.

04:19.490 --> 04:22.530
Yes. I would love to resolve this quickly.

04:22.900 --> 04:26.370
There is the problem of the demon 
that infiltrated Minerva, as well.

04:31.500 --> 04:33.310
I had a feeling it was you.

04:34.850 --> 04:35.990
Sorry.

04:36.690 --> 04:39.470
I heard Cecilia was having 
an arranged marriage,

04:40.010 --> 04:43.940
so I flew home in a panic 
and ran into the Beast.

04:43.940 --> 04:46.550
I've heard her arranged 
marriage was the king's order.

04:46.830 --> 04:48.790
You knew about it, too?

04:48.790 --> 04:53.310
I guess there's really nothing 
I can do for Cecilia at all.

04:53.540 --> 04:55.400
Are you being serious?

04:55.400 --> 04:59.370
The reason she didn't tell me 
about her arranged marriage

04:59.820 --> 05:03.350
must be because I'm of no more 
use to her as a person—

05:03.350 --> 05:06.820
no, as a demon—than that.

05:07.060 --> 05:11.450
There's no way Cecilia thinks 
you're someone so unimportant.

05:12.120 --> 05:16.630
She only appears so full of 
life when she's with you.

05:18.040 --> 05:20.460
It'd be great if that were true, but...

05:24.010 --> 05:25.800
I'm gonna focus on the quest for now.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.300
Hey, Celia!

05:30.300 --> 05:33.510
I got some nice herbs, 
so I made tea with them.

05:33.510 --> 05:34.560
Thank you.

05:37.790 --> 05:40.060
It smells lovely, and it's delicious.

05:41.030 --> 05:43.800
You two are such good kids.

05:43.800 --> 05:46.950
I'm grateful to Yoki for 
introducing me to you.

05:47.770 --> 05:51.130
Speaking of the captain, he 
hasn't been by in a while.

05:51.130 --> 05:53.580
Arranged marriage. Shock.

05:53.580 --> 05:56.540
That's all just part of the wheeling 
and dealing of the nobility.

05:56.540 --> 05:59.540
I understand why it worries Yoki so,

05:59.540 --> 06:02.980
but it seems like Cecilia is 
handling it rather poorly, as well.

06:17.170 --> 06:18.600
Pardon me.

06:22.110 --> 06:25.650
I thought Yoki hadn't 
been back for some time,

06:26.290 --> 06:28.580
but then he came back injured.

06:29.550 --> 06:32.270
That commotion with the demon at 
the gate must have been...

06:33.030 --> 06:35.530
Probably Captain.

06:35.530 --> 06:38.500
Because he heard I was 
at a marriage meeting?

06:39.050 --> 06:40.630
No, it's not that.

06:41.180 --> 06:44.350
Yoki doesn't care about me anymore.

06:45.150 --> 06:46.130
Milady...

06:46.570 --> 06:48.370
Exasperating woman.

06:48.370 --> 06:49.380
Huh?!

06:49.380 --> 06:51.250
No need to worry.

06:52.890 --> 06:55.940
Captain remains head over heels.

06:56.520 --> 07:00.220
So I really did hurt his feelings, then?

07:00.630 --> 07:03.250
Easy to imagine.

07:03.250 --> 07:06.010
Captain depressed.

07:07.450 --> 07:09.530
I'm the absolute worst!

07:11.350 --> 07:14.030
Milady, he's appeared again.

07:14.030 --> 07:15.530
The Beast of Blue Fire.

07:17.450 --> 07:19.540
A purse snatcher! Grab him!

07:20.090 --> 07:21.500
Out of my way!

07:24.420 --> 07:26.700
I am the Beast of Blue Fire!

07:26.700 --> 07:30.290
My blue flames eliminate all evil!

07:30.290 --> 07:32.840
Feel the soul of justice!

07:35.580 --> 07:36.950
Damn it!

07:40.310 --> 07:42.510
My purse!

07:43.970 --> 07:46.270
P-Please don't kill me!

07:46.270 --> 07:47.700
Pleading for your life?

07:47.700 --> 07:50.730
You will get what you deserve 
for hurting honest folks.

07:51.080 --> 07:52.130
Stop this!

07:52.910 --> 07:55.630
You're the Beast of Blue Fire, aren't you?

07:55.630 --> 07:58.110
Yes! I am the Beast of Blue Fire!

07:58.110 --> 08:01.910
There is no one who can stop my justice!

08:01.910 --> 08:03.940
I'm Cecily the adventurer.

08:03.940 --> 08:09.570
Beast of Blue Fire, why do you 
cause chaos throughout Minerva?

08:11.150 --> 08:13.160
Y-You're...

08:13.560 --> 08:14.850
Wait a minute!

08:14.850 --> 08:19.810
I'm only helping people who need 
it and carrying out justice!

08:19.810 --> 08:23.940
Your behavior is bothering people.

08:23.940 --> 08:26.440
I'm... bothering people?

08:26.440 --> 08:32.030
Also, because you look so much like him,

08:32.340 --> 08:36.450
you're undermining the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning's good deeds.

08:36.700 --> 08:39.700
I cannot allow you to get away with that.

08:41.650 --> 08:45.710
Just who are you to the Magic 
Swordsman of Black Lightning?

08:45.710 --> 08:47.710
Hey, it's the Magic Swordsman!

08:51.710 --> 08:55.720
Yo— Magic Swordsman? How 
long have you been there?

08:55.720 --> 08:59.970
Well... since you were talking 
about my good deeds...

09:02.170 --> 09:05.480
And... how long are you 
going to stand up there?

09:05.480 --> 09:09.110
R-Right.

09:09.800 --> 09:11.410
What the heck is going on?

09:11.410 --> 09:12.050
Dunno.

09:12.050 --> 09:15.400
One thing's for sure: that guy's not 
the Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning.

09:16.230 --> 09:20.880
Um, Ceci— Cecily, I 
know you're busy lately.

09:20.880 --> 09:22.970
Why do this for a nobody like me?

09:23.300 --> 09:24.660
You are not nobody!

09:24.660 --> 09:30.420
You've been working hard for 
the people ever since that day.

09:30.420 --> 09:31.470
So...

09:32.130 --> 09:34.890
I see... Thanks.

09:34.890 --> 09:36.680
Stay away from her!

09:38.220 --> 09:39.660
Hold it right there!

09:39.660 --> 09:43.470
For a guy in such a great chuuni 
costume, you just don't get it!

09:43.470 --> 09:44.470
What?

09:44.470 --> 09:48.040
Listen up! When you go in 
for the preemptive strike,

09:48.040 --> 09:50.170
you must proudly shout the 
name of your technique!

09:50.170 --> 09:53.090
Then you proclaim the 
greater good you fight for!

09:53.090 --> 09:55.190
What are you talking about?!

09:56.260 --> 10:01.160
Magic Swordsman of Black 
Lightning, what are you to her?!

10:01.160 --> 10:04.410
She is Cecily, the Guide 
of Love and Mercy...

10:04.410 --> 10:05.870
Don't give me weird nicknames!

10:05.870 --> 10:10.040
...and the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning's partner!

10:11.040 --> 10:14.540
I see. So that's what this is about.

10:15.050 --> 10:17.670
What is it that I'm lacking?

10:21.020 --> 10:23.210
Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning...

10:23.210 --> 10:25.060
I will defeat you!

10:25.340 --> 10:28.560
I must! Otherwise I can 
never move forward!

10:28.810 --> 10:31.060
And what are you talking about?!

10:31.060 --> 10:33.070
Very well. I will take you on.

10:33.070 --> 10:34.820
You understand him?!

10:34.820 --> 10:38.100
But we can't fight here on the street.

10:38.100 --> 10:39.320
Let us move elsewhere!

10:40.030 --> 10:42.200
No need to tell me!

10:44.120 --> 10:47.580
Blue fire glows far brighter 
than black lightning!

10:47.900 --> 10:49.860
Your time is over!

10:49.860 --> 10:53.850
The name "Black Lightning" does not 
refer to how strongly it glows.

10:55.480 --> 11:00.720
It only means that I carry out any 
quest at the speed of lightning!

11:00.720 --> 11:04.040
Try me if you think you can!

11:15.340 --> 11:17.270
You do possess a great deal of magic!

11:17.270 --> 11:19.860
But it won't be enough to defeat me!

11:20.110 --> 11:21.970
Don't you mock me!

11:22.510 --> 11:23.420
Which is he?

11:23.820 --> 11:25.120
Raven!

11:25.390 --> 11:26.970
What's all the commotion?

11:26.970 --> 11:30.860
The Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning 
is chasing that wanted man.

11:31.180 --> 11:32.120
Who's this?

11:33.220 --> 11:35.480
Oh... This is the Magic Swordsman's...

11:35.480 --> 11:37.130
I'm Cecily.

11:39.550 --> 11:42.700
I have trained more than anyone else!

11:42.700 --> 11:44.600
Ever since I was a young boy!

11:44.600 --> 11:46.370
Boasting is not a good look!

11:46.370 --> 11:47.540
You dare laugh at me?!

11:47.540 --> 11:50.430
I'm not laughing. But...

11:50.870 --> 11:54.150
why do you dress exactly like me?!

11:54.150 --> 11:55.690
Because...

11:56.380 --> 11:58.690
this has always been my dream!

11:59.250 --> 12:00.180
Oh?

12:05.140 --> 12:06.110
You saved us!

12:06.110 --> 12:06.700
Thank you!

12:06.700 --> 12:10.010
You had everything I ever wanted.

12:12.330 --> 12:15.960
I will not only defeat 
you—I will surpass you!

12:17.960 --> 12:19.370
Bring it on!

12:19.750 --> 12:22.520
Hit the Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning

12:22.520 --> 12:24.380
with all the sorrowful wailing you like!

12:31.140 --> 12:33.070
You want everything I have?

12:33.070 --> 12:34.390
That's right!

12:34.390 --> 12:37.700
But all I have is my proud chuuni soul!

12:37.700 --> 12:39.110
Don't lie!

12:39.110 --> 12:42.530
Then why stand out so
much? Why help people?

12:43.320 --> 12:46.190
Because you want all of 
their attention on you!

12:46.190 --> 12:49.910
You want them to shower you 
with gratitude and accolades!

12:49.910 --> 12:52.460
Not only them, but her, too...

12:52.990 --> 12:54.750
Why do you get all the attention?!

12:55.830 --> 13:01.890
I don't wear this black mask in 
the hopes of gaining anything.

13:04.210 --> 13:05.810
I do it because it's cool.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.930
Both this look and the chuuni thing.

13:09.220 --> 13:10.060
Wha—

13:11.430 --> 13:13.500
No matter who may disavow it,

13:13.500 --> 13:16.370
I live true to my own feelings.

13:17.130 --> 13:18.810
I do this because I want to!

13:23.590 --> 13:25.820
I walk my own path.

13:26.410 --> 13:30.910
Beast of Blue Fire! You should 
walk your own path, as well!

13:30.910 --> 13:33.910
M-My own... path...

13:35.740 --> 13:37.700
This was a good chuuni battle.

13:38.150 --> 13:39.590
Magic Swordsman.

13:39.590 --> 13:41.920
Don't you think you're 
getting a bit carried away?

13:43.530 --> 13:44.180
Yes, ma'am!

13:44.180 --> 13:44.820
Huh?!

13:44.820 --> 13:46.810
Beast! You sit, too!

13:46.810 --> 13:47.930
Wha?!

13:47.930 --> 13:50.160
Just sit on your heels for now!

13:50.160 --> 13:53.930
This is an unavoidable 
part of the chuuni path!

13:58.310 --> 14:02.980
Would the two of you be willing 
to hear what I have to say?

14:03.490 --> 14:04.320
Yes, ma'am.

14:04.320 --> 14:06.270
First, Magic Swordsman...

14:06.270 --> 14:08.080
Even if it was a setup,

14:08.080 --> 14:12.530
was it really necessary to draw it 
out into such a grandiose battle?

14:12.530 --> 14:13.630
Sorry.

14:14.280 --> 14:15.450
And you, Beast.

14:15.450 --> 14:18.700
How could you attack with no thought 
for the damage it could cause?

14:19.070 --> 14:20.080
I'm sorry.

14:20.760 --> 14:24.090
I just wanted to be seen by the people.

14:24.350 --> 14:27.030
I was always told that 
everything I did was expected.

14:27.030 --> 14:31.110
I felt as if no one would 
ever recognize my efforts.

14:31.600 --> 14:35.900
That's why I started to mimic the 
Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning,

14:35.900 --> 14:38.520
but all I did was cause 
trouble for everyone.

14:38.850 --> 14:40.100
Beast.

14:42.410 --> 14:45.590
You possess great power.

14:45.590 --> 14:49.610
From now on, try using 
that power for yourself.

14:49.610 --> 14:51.460
For myself?

14:51.460 --> 14:55.620
Yes. That will benefit the people in turn.

14:56.890 --> 14:58.100
Hey!

14:58.910 --> 15:01.630
Magic Swordsman! What are you doing?!

15:02.270 --> 15:05.210
Catch that damn Beast already!

15:05.210 --> 15:06.030
Wha...

15:06.370 --> 15:10.220
I must keep my identity 
concealed at any cost!

15:10.220 --> 15:12.060
I have to get away!

15:12.060 --> 15:15.760
Oh, very well, then. Leave it to me.

15:15.760 --> 15:17.430
What are you going to do?

15:19.140 --> 15:21.460
I am the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning!

15:21.460 --> 15:26.090
I have apprehended the Beast of Blue 
Fire who was terrorizing Minerva!

15:28.340 --> 15:33.650
And the Guide of Love and Mercy, 
Cecily, has reformed him!

15:33.650 --> 15:34.510
Huh?!

15:37.740 --> 15:39.280
And!

15:39.280 --> 15:42.890
I will personally compensate all damages 
caused by this chain of events!

15:42.890 --> 15:44.390
All those who have suffered,

15:44.390 --> 15:47.780
file a report with Kramen 
at the adventurers' guild!

15:47.780 --> 15:50.170
Screw you!

15:50.460 --> 15:52.280
Now, farewell!

16:28.780 --> 16:31.340
Wow... I feel like I'm flying!

16:48.060 --> 16:49.790
Listen, Cecilia...

16:50.210 --> 16:51.080
Um...

16:51.080 --> 16:55.070
Yoki, why don't we reminisce 
for just a few minutes?

16:56.970 --> 17:01.900
Frankly, the first time 
I met you, you scared me.

17:03.210 --> 17:06.810
When you told only me to stay 
behind, I was prepared to die.

17:07.700 --> 17:09.120
So after that, when you...

17:09.120 --> 17:11.210
Let's skip that part. It's embarrassing.

17:12.380 --> 17:16.720
Yoki, do you remember when you 
said you wanted to die that day?

17:17.010 --> 17:17.910
Yeah.

17:18.490 --> 17:20.210
How do you feel now?

17:20.210 --> 17:23.980
I want to live, of course. 
I'm having fun now.

17:25.270 --> 17:28.860
Ever since you came to Minerva,

17:28.860 --> 17:33.400
you've turned so many people's 
lives in a better direction.

17:33.770 --> 17:34.680
I have?

17:36.490 --> 17:39.130
I don't remember doing 
anything that special.

17:39.860 --> 17:41.080
You have!

17:42.080 --> 17:46.960
Even I feel like I can be a 
bit more free when I'm Cecily.

17:46.960 --> 17:49.660
Welcome to Chuuni World!

17:49.660 --> 17:51.870
I'm not sure what that 
means, but no thanks.

18:05.370 --> 18:09.460
Being with you has always 
felt so exciting and fun.

18:21.170 --> 18:23.840
You know, I... was kinda scared.

18:23.840 --> 18:26.380
I can't say what I was scared of, but...

18:26.380 --> 18:30.460
Now, I somehow feel relieved.

18:32.010 --> 18:35.490
To be honest, it's fine if 
my feelings aren't returned.

18:36.370 --> 18:41.210
But if you get married and 
go somewhere far away,

18:41.820 --> 18:43.410
I'll have nothing left but regrets.

18:48.710 --> 18:52.480
Cecilia... Please go out with me.

18:59.970 --> 19:04.050
I'm sorry. Could you 
wait for a little while?

19:06.900 --> 19:09.730
Now that you've been 
straightforward with me,

19:09.730 --> 19:11.940
I won't be ambiguous, either.

19:11.940 --> 19:15.650
Tomorrow, after I give my answer 
about the arranged marriage,

19:16.570 --> 19:18.150
meet me at the usual place.

19:18.150 --> 19:19.670
Okay. I'll be waiting.

19:27.350 --> 19:30.910
I wonder what's going on with 
Cecilia's arranged marriage.

19:30.910 --> 19:33.430
She said she'd turn him down, remember?

19:33.860 --> 19:36.150
Yeah, I know, but...

19:37.650 --> 19:40.740
So what's it going to be, Cecilia?

19:51.390 --> 19:56.310
Thank you for agreeing to this marriage 
meeting on such short notice.

19:56.310 --> 19:57.150
Not at all.

19:57.500 --> 19:59.280
Are you sure this was all right?

19:59.280 --> 20:02.880
Did you not have someone special already?

20:02.880 --> 20:05.080
Huh? N-No...

20:05.080 --> 20:06.890
The Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning.

20:07.970 --> 20:10.140
He said you were his partner.

20:10.140 --> 20:12.800
Are you saying you're...

20:12.800 --> 20:14.630
the Beast of Blue Fire?!

20:17.700 --> 20:20.020
I was hoping to meet him.

20:20.020 --> 20:20.650
Huh?

20:20.650 --> 20:24.330
Not the Magic Swordsman of Black 
Lightning, but the man himself.

20:25.090 --> 20:26.660
Well, until next time.

20:38.810 --> 20:41.980
So he was the Beast of Blue Fire?

20:42.470 --> 20:43.490
Thanks.

20:51.430 --> 20:54.080
These moments started 
to feel so comfortable

20:54.080 --> 20:56.620
that I wished they'd last forever.

20:59.520 --> 21:02.980
But just wishing for it isn't enough.

21:07.170 --> 21:08.240
Cecilia...

21:08.240 --> 21:09.930
Y-Yes?

21:09.930 --> 21:10.870
Um...

21:12.510 --> 21:13.580
I love you.

21:14.230 --> 21:18.500
I know I'm not much, but I hope 
you'll still stick with me.

21:31.430 --> 21:34.170
I... love you, too.

21:34.590 --> 21:37.710
I know I'm not much, but I hope 
you'll still stick with me.

21:40.970 --> 21:42.690
Well, then, um...

21:43.180 --> 21:44.440
R-Right...

21:49.190 --> 21:51.950
Um... is this how you do it?

21:52.550 --> 21:55.480
I... I think so, yes.

21:59.730 --> 22:03.000
Yoki, shall we have tea?

22:04.260 --> 22:04.940
Sure.

22:06.040 --> 22:09.260
Shiek brought us these 
tea leaves, you know.

22:09.260 --> 22:12.520
Really? I thought all he 
did was eat and drink.

22:12.520 --> 22:17.390
That's mean! You drink a lot yourself!

22:17.390 --> 22:21.310
Well, yeah, because the 
tea you make is so good.

22:21.310 --> 22:23.380
You're not getting out of this one.

22:28.300 --> 22:31.560
Translation: Rebecca Cottrill
Timing: Andy Ellis

22:34.970 --> 22:38.280
Editing: Ashley Barboza
Quality Control: Riley Dalton

22:38.310 --> 22:41.620
Translation Check: Rei Miyasaka
